itCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>623</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66893,"threadID":4513,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"","time":1496926342,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><s>069</s></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>777</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66896,"threadID":4513,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1496928634,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>832</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66898,"threadID":4513,"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","subject":"","time":1496930545,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>688</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66905,"threadID":4513,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1496940227,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1496941315,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Verlosung wird um 19:00 Aufgelöst.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66907,"threadID":4513,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1496942517,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Und die Gewinnnumer ist...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Damit hat Mason gewonnen, ich habe ihn daraufhin kontaktiert um ihn über seinen Gewinn zu Informieren. Leider besitzt er kein Town Of Salem, hätte nicht gedacht, dass er gewinnt und hat auch nicht vor sich die Grundversion zu kaufen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Aus diesem Grund wird die nächste Zahl gewählt, da Mason seine Teilnahme zurückzieht.<br>Somit gewinnt die &#x27;66&#x27; <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> bitte umgehend bei mir melden.<br>Wenn du mich bis morgen Abend nicht kontaktiert hast geht der gewinn an die nächst höhere Zahl.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Proof:<br><span class=\"metacode-inline\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dv-m9T54SI0&amp;feature=youtu.be</span><br></p></details><p><br></p></div><p>Beste Grüße,<br>wickedy</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66908,"threadID":4513,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","subject":"","time":1496942759,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> nice proof<br>Video nicht verfügbar</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66909,"threadID":4513,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1496943612,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Unicorn24</strong></cite><p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> nice proof<br>Video nicht verfügbar<br></p></blockquote><p>fixed</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66913,"threadID":4513,"userID":2408,"username":"KlitschkoS","subject":"","time":1496947591,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>HGW <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66915,"threadID":4513,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":14969